@prefix :     <http://example.org/t#> .
@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .

<http://example.org/t> a owl:Ontology .

:B a owl:Class . :D a owl:Class . :r a owl:ObjectProperty , owl:FunctionalProperty .
:a a owl:NamedIndividual ; :r :b , :c .
:b a owl:NamedIndividual , :B .
:c a owl:NamedIndividual , :D .
:d a owl:NamedIndividual , :D .
